{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46116","headline":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 五 · 贯休","name":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫勋业正乾坤，麟凤龟龙尽在门。\n西伯最怜耕让畔，曹参空爱酒盈樽。\n心慈爲受金仙嘱，发白缘酬玉砌恩。\n从此于门转高大，可怜子子与孙孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}